    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1932" root="بد" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُدَّةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُدٌّ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A distance; a space;
an interval; an extent,</i> or <i>an extreme extent; a
long space,</i> or <i>any space, of time.</i> (M, K, * TA.) So
in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنِى وَ بَيْنَكَ بُدَّةٌ</span> [<i>Between me and
thee is a distance,</i> &amp;c.]. (M, TA.)

